WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Ryu uses Drive Reversal after Juri’s opening jab.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.300
Juri’s Drive Impact absorbs the recorded Drive Reversal.

3
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Juri’s Drive Impact Punish Counters Ryu into a crumple.

4
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.800
Standing heavy punch starts the crumple conversion.

5
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.800
Heavy Fuhajin launches Ryu.

6
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.100
Heavy Tensenrin finishes the Drive Reversal response.
